WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.205
Forma is a two-million-dollar-a-month e-commerce brand.

00:00:03.205 --> 00:00:09.383
To grow toward five million, its founder needs to see which decisions the team owns, and where to step in.

00:00:10.056 --> 00:00:11.032
Open Marketing.

00:00:11.032 --> 00:00:15.585
Olivia, the Head of Creative, hit her own target of eight winning ads.

00:00:15.585 --> 00:00:19.554
Her card is orange because of a result further down the team.

00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:23.232
In Results, the team alert points to Ethan.

00:00:23.232 --> 00:00:27.169
He delivered twelve video ads against a target of twenty.

00:00:27.169 --> 00:00:29.172
Red means below target today.

00:00:29.172 --> 00:00:30.899
It does not mean overdue.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.851
When the remaining ads ship, change the actual to twenty and save.

00:00:35.851 --> 00:00:38.170
Olivia’s alert clears automatically.

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.618
Other branches keep their own signals.

00:00:41.324 --> 00:00:43.995
Metrics compares every role in one table.

00:00:43.995 --> 00:00:46.536
Goals tracks extra outcomes separately.

00:00:46.536 --> 00:00:50.184
Finance has a cash forecast for eight of thirteen weeks.

00:00:50.184 --> 00:00:53.246
Ethan has completed all four editing templates.

00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:55.801
The retention role is vacant.

00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:57.516
Assign Jordan Lee and save.

00:00:57.516 --> 00:01:04.061
It now shows missing data instead of a vacancy, because the role has an owner but no actual result yet.

00:01:04.775 --> 00:01:08.575
Discuss with AI carries the selected role into the conversation.

00:01:08.575 --> 00:01:11.960
The assistant can explain a result or propose a new role.

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.573
You review changes before anything is saved.

00:01:15.278 --> 00:01:17.662
The workspace is saved in this browser.

00:01:17.662 --> 00:01:20.351
Refresh the chart and Jordan is still there.

00:01:20.351 --> 00:01:25.731
The founder can see who owns the work, what changed, and where attention is needed next.
